  "reasoning": "The facts describe three distinct criminal conduct by the public official: (1) accepting cash, shopping cards and gold in exchange for using his official position – this is the crime of bribery (受贿罪). (2) Unilaterally diverting public funds of the state‑owned housing company to a private individual – this constitutes embezzlement of public funds (挪用公款罪). (3) Possessing a large amount of personal assets that cannot be accounted for by lawful income – this matches the offense of receiving huge unexplained property (收受巨额财产罪). Therefore the appropriate charges are the three crimes listed.",
